*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*cupsLanguages: "ru"
*PCFileName: "XMDYA4.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "XMDY"
*Product: "(A4RJ)"
*ModelName: "XMDY A4RJ"
*ShortNickName: "XMDY A4RJ"
*NickName: "XMDY A4RJ Thermal, rastertoxmdy 1.0.0"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:XMDY;MDL:A4RJ;CMD:XPP,XL;CLS:PRINTER;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/XMDY-A4/Filter/rastertoxmdy"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "0 0 420 595"
*ImageableArea B5/B5: "0 0 499 709"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B5/B5: "499 709"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenGroup: XmdyQuality/Print Quality

*OpenUI *XmdyDensity/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyDensity
*DefaultXmdyDensity: 1
*XmdyDensity 0/Light: ""
*XmdyDensity 1/Normal: ""
*XmdyDensity 2/Dark: ""
*XmdyDensity 3/Extra Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyDensity

*OpenUI *XmdyThreshold/Black Threshold: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyThreshold
*DefaultXmdyThreshold: 128
*XmdyThreshold 96/Light: ""
*XmdyThreshold 128/Normal: ""
*XmdyThreshold 160/Bold: ""
*XmdyThreshold 192/Extra Bold: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyThreshold

*OpenUI *XmdyDither/Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyDither
*DefaultXmdyDither: Threshold
*XmdyDither Threshold/Text and graphics: ""
*XmdyDither Diffusion/Photo (error diffusion): ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyDither

*OpenUI *XmdyNegative/Negative Image: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyNegative
*DefaultXmdyNegative: False
*XmdyNegative True/On: ""
*XmdyNegative False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyNegative

*OpenUI *XmdyMirror/Mirror Image: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyMirror
*DefaultXmdyMirror: False
*XmdyMirror True/On: ""
*XmdyMirror False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyMirror

*CloseGroup: XmdyQuality

*OpenGroup: XmdyPaper/Paper Handling

*OpenUI *XmdyMediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyMediaType
*DefaultXmdyMediaType: Continuous
*XmdyMediaType Continuous/Continuous roll: ""
*XmdyMediaType Marks/Folded paper with marks: ""
*XmdyMediaType Tattoo/Tattoo paper: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyMediaType

*OpenUI *XmdyTrim/Skip Blank Space at Page End: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyTrim
*DefaultXmdyTrim: False
*XmdyTrim True/On: ""
*XmdyTrim False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyTrim

*OpenUI *XmdyOffsetX/Horizontal Offset: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyOffsetX
*DefaultXmdyOffsetX: 0
*XmdyOffsetX -5/5 mm left: ""
*XmdyOffsetX -3/3 mm left: ""
*XmdyOffsetX -1/1 mm left: ""
*XmdyOffsetX 0/None: ""
*XmdyOffsetX 1/1 mm right: ""
*XmdyOffsetX 3/3 mm right: ""
*XmdyOffsetX 5/5 mm right: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyOffsetX

*OpenUI *XmdyFeedBefore/Feed Before Document: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyFeedBefore
*DefaultXmdyFeedBefore: 0
*XmdyFeedBefore 0/0 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedBefore 5/5 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedBefore 10/10 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedBefore 20/20 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyFeedBefore

*OpenUI *XmdyPageFeed/Feed After Each Page: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyPageFeed
*DefaultXmdyPageFeed: 0
*XmdyPageFeed 0/0 mm: ""
*XmdyPageFeed 5/5 mm: ""
*XmdyPageFeed 10/10 mm: ""
*XmdyPageFeed 20/20 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyPageFeed

*OpenUI *XmdyFeedAfter/Feed After Document: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *XmdyFeedAfter
*DefaultXmdyFeedAfter: 12
*XmdyFeedAfter 0/0 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedAfter 5/5 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedAfter 12/12 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedAfter 20/20 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedAfter 30/30 mm: ""
*XmdyFeedAfter 50/50 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *XmdyFeedAfter

*CloseGroup: XmdyPaper

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM

